   "cooked": "<p>I’m all dressed up and ready to applaud <img alt=\":cat:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/cat.png?v=9\" title=\":cat:\"/>‍:dragon:!</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"316\" data-username=\"divine_comedian\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"avatar\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/user_avatar/forum.tecommons.org/divine_comedian/40/196_2.png\" width=\"20\"/> divine_comedian:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This template is in completion and will be ready to deploy today, April 1, 2021.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><img alt=\":thinking:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/thinking.png?v=9\" title=\":thinking:\"/> <img alt=\":rofl:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/rofl.png?v=9\" title=\":rofl:\"/></p>",
